        title: "Anchor Text",
        content: "Read the following passages carefully before proceeding:\n\n\u2022 John 1:1-3, 14 \u2014 The Word who was God became flesh\n\u2022 Colossians 1:15-19 \u2014 The supremacy and sufficiency of Christ\n\u2022 Philippians 2:5-11 \u2014 The self-emptying of the eternal Son",
