        content: 'Read the following passages carefully before proceeding:\n\n\u2022 Hebrews 2:17-18 \u2014 Christ made like His brothers in every respect\n\u2022 John 10:30 \u2014 "I and My Father are one"\n\u2022 1 Timothy 2:5 \u2014 One mediator between God and humanity',
