        content: 'Read the following passages carefully before proceeding:\n\nGenesis 1:1-2 \u2014 The Spirit hovering over the waters at creation.\nJohn 14:16-18 \u2014 Jesus promises "another Helper" who will remain forever.\nJohn 14:26 \u2014 The Spirit will teach and bring remembrance.\nJohn 16:7-13 \u2014 The Spirit convicts the world and guides into all truth.\n\nAs you read, notice the personal pronouns Jesus uses for the Spirit. He does not say "it" \u2014 He says "He."',
