        title: "Anchor Text",
        content: "Read the following passages:\n\nGalatians 5:22-25 \u2014 The fruit of the Spirit.\nEphesians 5:18 \u2014 Be filled with the Spirit.\nActs 1:8 \u2014 You shall receive power when the Holy Spirit comes upon you.\n\nNotice the contrast Paul draws between the works of the flesh and the fruit of the Spirit. Fruit is singular \u2014 one organic cluster produced by one indwelling Source.",
