        content: "Read the following passages:\n\n1 John 4:1 \u2014 Test the spirits to see whether they are from God.\n1 Thessalonians 5:19-21 \u2014 Do not quench the Spirit. Test everything; hold fast what is good.\nEphesians 4:30 \u2014 Do not grieve the Holy Spirit of God.\n\nThese texts establish guardrails: the Spirit's work must be tested, never quenched, and never grieved. Each guardrail addresses a different type of error.",
