        title: "Anchor Text",
        content: "Read the following passages in full before proceeding:\n\nGenesis 1:1-2:3 \u2014 The seven-day creation account.\nExodus 20:8-11 \u2014 The Sabbath commandment, grounded in the creation week.\nPsalm 33:6,9 \u2014 'By the word of the LORD the heavens were made... He spoke, and it was done.'\n\nAs you read Genesis 1, pay attention to the repeated structure: God speaks, it is so, God evaluates it as good. The seventh day breaks the pattern \u2014 no creation, no evening/morning formula. Rest replaces productivity.",
