        content: "Read the following passages:\n\nHebrews 11:3 \u2014 By faith we understand that the universe was framed by the word of God.\nJohn 1:1-3 \u2014 All things were made through the Word.\nColossians 1:16-17 \u2014 By Him all things were created, and in Him all things hold together.\n\nNotice how each passage connects creation to the spoken word of God and to the Person of Christ. Creation is not an abstract event \u2014 it is a relational act performed by a personal God.",
