        title: "Anchor Text",
        content: 'Read the following passages carefully before proceeding:\n\n"But grow in the grace and knowledge of our Lord and Savior Jesus Christ. To Him be the glory both now and forever. Amen." \u2014 2 Peter 3:18 (NKJV)\n\n"Now the Lord is the Spirit; and where the Spirit of the Lord is, there is liberty. But we all, with unveiled face, beholding as in a mirror the glory of the Lord, are being transformed into the same image from glory to glory, just as by the Spirit of the Lord." \u2014 2 Corinthians 3:17-18 (NKJV)\n\n"Now may the God of peace Himself sanctify you completely; and may your whole spirit, soul, and body be preserved blameless at the coming of our Lord Jesus Christ. He who calls you is faithful, who also will do it." \u2014 1 Thessalonians 5:23-24 (NKJV)',
